    title: "swift: initialisers the binding pass cannot type (generic identity stored(Session()), XCTest expectation(), string literals, non-self member chains, ??) -- since WI-silos an untyped local shadows, these are measured recall losses (Kingfisher: 3 catalogued FileManager fs chains)"  # d7d6
